        <p>PowerView is Hunter Douglas's motorization system. Set your shades to rise with the sun and close at sunset, protect your floors and furniture from afternoon glare, and set the mood for the evening, all without lifting a cord.</p>
        <ul class="perks">
          <li>Control your shades with the Pebble<sup>®</sup> remote, a wall switch, or the PowerView app</li>
          <li>Set schedules and scenes so shades move on their own throughout the day</li>
          <li>Works with Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant</li>
          <li>Cordless, so it's safer for children and pets</li>
          <li>Motorized drapery hardware is available too</li>
        </ul>
